/* HG2D_DATA_POINTER(at, target): the pointers into its own data that HG2D installs at attach.  The word at
 * hg2d_image + at becomes the address of hg2d_image + target.  These are the 55 slots of retail's relocated set whose
 * value points inside retail's .data (retail holds 0x20792000 + target, its image base plus .data's RVA), listed in
 * ascending slot order.  tools/check_data_image.py (row HG2D, ptrs=) proves each slot and target against retail, and
 * --hash pins the list.  The other 40 relocated slots that read zero in the image (+0x3c, +0x40 and +0x50..+0xf4 apart from
 * +0xc4..+0xd0) are service and Linkage slots set in C by DllMain. */
